Package: TxPathways
Title: Module to run treatment patterns
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Martin", "Lavallee", , "martin.lavallee@boehringer-ingelheim.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Katy", "Sadowski", , "katy.sadowski@boehringer-ingelheim.com", role = c("aut"))
  )
Description: Build treatment history using target and event cohorts via a zero-iteration SQL CTE pipeline that runs entirely in the DBMS. Then run analytics (pathways, duration, adherence, situation counts/times, exit reasons) and produce sankey/sunburst visualizations off this construction.
